### Test Ping
GET http://localhost:8081/ping

### ===============================
### AUTHENTICATION (PASSWORDLESS)
### ===============================

### 1. Request OTP (dikirim ke email peserta; OTP tidak ada di response)
# Lokal tanpa SMTP: set OTP_DEV_LOG=true di .env lalu cek log server
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/request-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nim": "20260023222"
}

### 2. Verify OTP (Login & Dapatkan Token)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nim": "20260023222",
    "otp": "GANTI_DENGAN_OTP_YANG_DIDAPAT"
}

> {% client.global.set("mhs_token", response.body.token); %}

### ===============================
### PESERTA (MAHASISWA)
### ===============================

### Register Peserta Baru
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/peserta/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nama": " Sharon,Georgina Mailangkay",
    "email": "SharonMailangkay@gmail.com",
    "nim": "20260023222",
    "prodi": "Teknik Informatika"
}

### ===============================
### ADMIN APIs
### ===============================

### Admin Login
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/auth/admin-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "admin@kkn.ac.id",
    "password": "admin123"
}

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.token); %}

### Get Semua Peserta (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/admin/peserta
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Get Peserta By ID (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/admin/peserta/3
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Update Status Peserta (Admin Only)
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/v1/admin/peserta/3/status
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
    "status": "approved"
}

### Tambah Lokasi KKN (Admin Only)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/admin/lokasi/
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
    "nama_desa": "Maju Jaya",
    "kecamatan": "Makmur",
    "kuota": 20
}

### Lihat Semua Lokasi (Admin Only)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/admin/lokasi/
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Plotting Mahasiswa ke Lokasi (Admin Only)
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/v1/admin/peserta/1/lokasi
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

{
    "lokasi_id": 1
}

### ===============================
### MAHASISWA APIs (Membutuhkan Token Login OTP)
### ===============================

### Profil Mahasiswa (dari JWT)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/mahasiswa/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{mhs_token}}

### Buat Invoice Pembayaran (peserta_id dari JWT)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/mahasiswa/pembayaran/invoice
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{mhs_token}}

{
    "amount": 500000
}

### Cek Status Pembayaran (milik user yang login)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/mahasiswa/pembayaran
Authorization: Bearer {{mhs_token}}

### Lihat Notifikasi (milik user yang login)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/mahasiswa/notifikasi
Authorization: Bearer {{mhs_token}}

### Tandai Notifikasi Sebagai Dibaca (hanya milik user yang login)
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/v1/mahasiswa/notifikasi/1/read
Authorization: Bearer {{mhs_token}}

### ===============================
### WEBHOOKS & PUBLIC APIs
### ===============================

### Webhook Notifikasi Midtrans (payload lengkap + signature_key dari Midtrans)
# Untuk simulasi lokal: set MIDTRANS_SKIP_SIGNATURE_VERIFY=true di .env
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/pembayaran/notification
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "order_id": "INV-GANTI_DENGAN_ORDER_ID_ANDA",
    "status_code": "200",
    "gross_amount": "500000.00",
    "transaction_status": "settlement",
    "fraud_status": "accept",
    "signature_key": "GANTI_DENGAN_SIGNATURE_KEY_DARI_MIDTRANS"
}
